        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;%% Logistics-Route-Decider-System - Navigation model (Lab 10)\n%% Editable source. Render at https://mermaid.live. Exported view: models/navigation.svg\n%% Thick arrows (==&gt;) mark critical task paths: T1 generate route, T2 record delivery, T3 reassign route.\nflowchart LR\n  LOGIN[\&quot;Login\&quot;]\n\n  subgraph D[\&quot;DISPATCHER - web (desktop browser)\&quot;]\n    DASH[\&quot;Dashboard:&lt;br/&gt;Pending Deliveries&lt;br/&gt;(landing)\&quot;]\n    REV[\&quot;Route Review&lt;br/&gt;(draft route)\&quot;]\n    ACT[\&quot;Active Routes\&quot;]\n    DET[\&quot;Route Detail&lt;br/&gt;(stops, status, reorder)\&quot;]\n    REA[\&quot;Reassign Driver&lt;br/&gt;(dialog)\&quot;]\n    DRV[\&quot;Drivers&lt;br/&gt;(availability)\&quot;]\n    REP[\&quot;Reports and History\&quot;]\n    NAV[\&quot;Top navigation on every screen:&lt;br/&gt;Dashboard | Active Routes | Drivers | Reports\&quot;]\n  end\n\n  subgraph R[\&quot;DRIVER - mobile\&quot;]\n    MY[\&quot;My Route&lt;br/&gt;(landing)\&quot;]\n    NODE[\&quot;Delivery Detail\&quot;]\n  end\n\n  LOGIN -- \&quot;role = Dispatcher\&quot; --&gt; DASH\n  LOGIN -- \&quot;role = Driver\&quot; --&gt; MY\n\n  DASH == \&quot;T1: Generate Route\&quot; ==&gt; REV\n  REV == \&quot;T1: Confirm and Assign\&quot; ==&gt; ACT\n  REV -- \&quot;Cancel / edit selection\&quot; --&gt; DASH\n\n  ACT -- \&quot;open route\&quot; --&gt; DET\n  ACT == \&quot;T3: Reassign (row action)\&quot; ==&gt; REA\n  DET -- \&quot;Reassign\&quot; --&gt; REA\n  REA -- \&quot;Confirm returns to\&quot; --&gt; ACT\n\n  NAV -.-&gt; DRV\n  NAV -.-&gt; REP\n  NAV -.-&gt; ACT\n\n  MY == \&quot;T2: tap delivery\&quot; ==&gt; NODE\n  NODE == \&quot;T2: tap Completed / Failed / Pending\&quot; ==&gt; MY&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="Cj2OxVTCG8FgAXbv9bFZ-1">
